  "lemmas": [
    {
      "lemma": "property lemma_1; @(posedge clock) (itfc_state == `G_LOAD) |-> (confirm == 0); endproperty",
      "explanation": "Initially the interface is idle. Entering G_LOAD clears confirm; while in G_LOAD, confirm is unchanged. Thus the lemma is 1-inductive. With it, prop is 1-inductive: an idle step clears confirm, and a G_LOAD step preserves confirm at zero."
    }
  ]
}
</json>

Assert the unclocked `prop` on `posedge clock`, or provide an equivalent default clocking. ([accellera.org](https://accellera.org/images/eda/sv-ec/8246.html?utm_source=openai))
